<%- include('partials/header', { title }) %>
<section class="dashboard-page"><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR JOB SEARCH</span><h1>My <span>applications.</span></h1><p>Keep track of the opportunities you've applied for.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/jobs">Explore jobs <span>→</span></a></div><% if (!applications.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">↗</div><h3>Your next opportunity is waiting</h3><p>You haven't applied for a role yet. Explore jobs and take the first step.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/jobs">Browse open jobs</a></div><% } else { %><div class="dashboard-job-list"><% applications.forEach(application => { %><article class="dashboard-job"><div class="company-mark mark-1"><%= application.job ? application.job.company.slice(0,1).toUpperCase() : '?' %></div><div class="dashboard-job-info"><h3><%= application.job ? application.job.title : 'Job no longer available' %></h3><p><%= application.job ? application.job.company + ' · ' + application.job.location : 'This posting has been removed.' %></p><span class="applicant-count">Applied <%= application.appliedAt.toLocaleDateString() %></span></div><span class="status-pill status-<%= application.status.toLowerCase() %>"><%= application.status %></span></article><% }) %></div><% } %></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
